  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 44 - 96 × 4 ÷ 3 + 58 = 30\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the two signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : - and ÷ \n\n44 - 96 × 4 ÷ 3 + 58 = 30 ⇒ **44 ÷ 96**__ × 4 - 3 + 58 = 30\n\n__**0.45 × 4**__ - 3 + 58 = 30\n\n__**1.8 + 58**__ - 3 = 30\n\n__**59.8 - 3**__ = 30\n\n56.8 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × and + \n\n44 - 96 × 4 ÷ 3 + 58 = 30 ⇒ 44 - 96 + **4 ÷ 3**__ × 58 = 30\n\n44 - 96 + __1.33** × 58**__ = 30\n\n__**44 + 77.14**__ - 96 = 30\n\n__**121.14 - 96**__ = 30\n\n25.14 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and - \n\n44 - 96 × 4 ÷ 3 + 58 = 30 ⇒ 44 + 96 × **4 ÷ 3**__ - 58 = 30\n\n44 + __**96 × **____1.33__ - 58 = 30\n\n__**44 + **__**__127.68__** - 58 = 30\n\n__**171.68 - 58**__ = 30\n\n113.68 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ and x \n\n44 - 96 × 4 ÷ 3 + 58 = 30 ⇒ 44 - **96 ÷ 4**__ × 3 + 58 = 30\n\n44 - __24____** × 3**__ + 58 = 30\n\n__**44 + 58**__ - 72 = 30\n\n__**102 - 72**__ = 30\n\n**30 = 30 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
